<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Philemon</book>
  <para style="h">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philemon</para>
  <para style="mt">Philemon</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Khrist Jesu hentapa leh i unaupa Timothi in, ka deihtak leh ka sepgimpih uh Philemon kiang leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka sanggamnu uh Apphia kiang ah, ka sepaihpih uh Arkipas kiang leh na inn a saptuam kikhawmte kiang ah leng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian i Pa leh Toupa Jesu Khrist kiang a kipan hehpihna leh lemna na kiang uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thumnate ah na minlou gige in, ka Pathian kiang ah kipahthu ka gen hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa Jesu lam leh misiangthou tengteng lam a itna leh ginna na neih za in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ginna ki koppihna, noumau a om thil hoih chiteng theihkimna lam ah Khrist lam a a hong phattuam theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Unaupa aw, nangmah ziak a misiangthoute lungtang a hong halhtak ziak in na itna ah ka kipakin ka kha a muang mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in a kilawm hun hih ding in nang thu honpiak Khrist ah kingap mah leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Itna ziak in, Paul putek hial ka hi a, tun ah Khrist Jesu hentapa ka hita a, a nget in k’on ngenzaw hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ta Onesima, kolbun kawm a ka neihkhiak, amah a ding in na kiang ah ka ngetsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuma lam in nang ading in a phatuam kei a, tun zaw kei leh nang ading in a phatuamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah, ka lungtang mahmah na kiang ah k’on sawlkik nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah Tanchinhoih a ka kolbutna a nangmah sik a nna a hon sepsak theihna ding in ka kiang a omsak nilouh ka ut mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh na hehpihna hehpihsak teitei bang hilou in, na thu bang ahihtheih zawkna ding in, na thulou in bangmah hih ka ut kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sawtloukal nang a honkhen tangtawn a amah na neih tawntungna ding ziak ahikha mai ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh sikha bang hi nawnlou a, sikha sang a hoih unau deihtak bang zaw in; kei ading in deihtak a hituama, nang ading ngial in sa leh Toupa ah nak hihna in chia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in, lawma n’on sim leh keimah bang in amah na kipahpihin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan na tung a banghiam a hihkhelh a, na thil banghiam a bat leh keimah bat in bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei Paul in keima khut ngei a ka gelh ahi. Keimah in ka ditsak ding hi; ka kiang a nangma’n leng bat na neihsam dan honhilh zaw ka hi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi, unaupa aw, nangmah ziak in Toupa ah ka kipahna hon neisak inla, Khrist ah leng ka lungtang hihhalh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka gen sang a thupizaw tham in na hih ding chih ka theih ziak in, n’on man gingta in na kiang ah ka gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abang abang hileh, huai kia hihlou in, tunna ding hon na suktuah sak in; na thumnate uh ziak in na kiang ua piak ka hi ding chih ka kigingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Epaphras, Khrist Jesu a ka hentakpih pa’n chibai a honbuk hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in ka seppih Mark, Aristarkhas, Demas, leh Luke te’n leng chibai a honbuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna na kha uah om hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
